---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ButtonLink from '@components/ButtonLink.astro';
import { routes } from '@config/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Share Your Dog’s Health History — BarkLens"
  description="Share one link or QR code so a veterinarian, specialist, sitter, or family member can see your dog’s history."
  canonicalPath="/your-records-are-yours/"
>
  <article class="records-page">
    <header class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Share the history</p>
      <h1>The next person to see your dog shouldn’t start from zero.</h1>
      <p>Every BarkLens account has a share link and a QR code. Send it before you drive over. Show it at the desk. Whoever is standing there can see the history.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="records-page__grid container">
      <div>
        <section>
          <h2>How you hand it off</h2>
          <p>Show the QR on your phone.</p>
          <p>Or send the URL.</p>
          <p>You choose who can open it.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="records-page__moments">
          <h2>When it matters</h2>
          <article>
            <h3>The ER at night</h3>
            <p>There is no folder in the car. Open the QR at intake. They can see current medications, recent labs, and the rest of the history while you explain what happened tonight.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>A specialist on Thursday</h3>
            <p>Send the link before you leave the house. They can read the last two years instead of starting from the clipboard in the lobby.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>Someone else is at the appointment</h3>
            <p>A partner. A sitter. Family. Boarding. They already have the link. They don’t have to text you for the medication name.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>A new clinic. A move. A second opinion.</h3>
            <p>The history does not live in the last portal. It goes with you.</p>
          </article>
        </section>
      </div>
      <aside>
        <p class="eyebrow">The share</p>
        <blockquote>Show the QR.<br />Send the link.<br />They’re already oriented.</blockquote>
        <ButtonLink href={routes.waitlist} variant="mint">Join Waitlist</ButtonLink>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .records-page > header { padding-block: var(--space-24) var(--space-16); }
  .records-page h1 { max-width: 14ch; margin-top: var(--space-5); font-size: var(--text-2xl); }
  .records-page header > p:last-child { max-width: 42ch; margin-top: var(--space-6); font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--text-lg); }
  .records-page__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 20rem; gap: var(--space-20); padding-bottom: var(--space-20); }
  .records-page__grid > div { max-width: var(--content-narrow); }
  .records-page section + section { margin-top: var(--space-12); padding-top: var(--space-12); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .records-page h2 { font-size: var(--text-xl); }
  .records-page h3 { margin-top: var(--space-8); font-size: var(--text-lg); }
  .records-page section p { margin-top: var(--space-5); color: var(--color-copy-muted); }
  .records-page__moments article + article { margin-top: var(--space-10); padding-top: var(--space-10); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .records-page__moments article p { margin-top: var(--space-4); }
  .records-page aside { position: sticky; top: calc(var(--header-height) + var(--space-6)); padding: var(--space-8); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); background: var(--color-forest-900); color: var(--color-copy-inverse); }
  .records-page aside .eyebrow { color: var(--color-mint-400); }
  .records-page blockquote { margin-top: var(--space-5); font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--text-xl); line-height: 1.35; }
  .records-page aside :global(.button-link) { width: 100%; margin-top: var(--space-6); }
  @media (max-width: 63.99rem) { .records-page__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .records-page aside { position: static; } }
</style>
